{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24219","headline":"闲卧有所思二首 一 · 白居易","name":"闲卧有所思二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"向夕搴帘卧枕琴，微凉入户起开襟。\n偶因明月清风夜，忽想迁臣逐客心。\n何处投荒初恐惧，谁人绕泽正悲吟。\n始知洛下分司坐，一日安闲直万金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}